<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Abiding in Christ the Vine,</l><l>His living supply I take.</l><l>His joy is becoming mine,</l><l>By calling upon His name.</l><l>This fullness of joy in me</l><l>Displaces anxiety,</l><l>And fills me with utter peace,</l><l>For Christ is my everything!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
